        {
          "type": "output_text",
          "text": "I could not complete the event-level determination because the cost-event records are restricted to the records-custodian role. The readable records identify **WO-2025-09-004**, **MO-25-09-1070**, at Racine, and show that September period **PER-COST-2025-09** entered **PENDING_CLOSE** at **2025-09-30T18:00:00**.\n\nThe Oracle 26B policy excerpt says newly created transactions falling in or before a Pending Close period are not staged for accounting until the period is closed or reopened. But I could not verify the source transaction ID, amount, event-created time, or recorded accounting status, so I cannot calculate the lateness or determine whether the recorded status was consistent with that policy. The protected-record read returned a 403 access denial. I requested authorized access through the supervisor and submitted the review as incomplete; **no database records were changed**.",
